  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Gas A is at a temperature of 100 K and the average speed of its molecules is 2<em>v</em>. Gas B is at a temperature of 200 K and the average speed of its molecules is <em>v</em>.</p>\n<p>What is the ratio of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Molar  mass  of  gas  A}{Molar  mass  of  gas  B}\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{8}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">2</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">8</li>\n</ol>"
